    "common_mistakes": [
      "Submitting the solar permit without structural calculations for the warehouse roof \u2014 commercial rooftop systems often get held for roof load verification",
      "Missing required fire access pathways and roof setbacks \u2014 panels cannot cover the full roof and inspectors will fail the job if clear access routes are blocked",
      "Assuming permit approval means the system can be energized \u2014 utility permission to operate is separate and must be obtained before turn-on",
      "Incorrect NEC 690 labeling on disconnects, combiner boxes, and conduits \u2014 missing labels are a common final inspection failure",
